{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-gateway","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"gateway-premier-choice-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Gateway is a luxury residential development by developer Premier Choice. The building consists of 17 floors and is located in the Jumeirah Village Circle neighborhood. The interior of Gateway is characterized by modern finishes and furnishings, providing the ultimate combination of luxury and comfort. The complex is suitable for personal living as well as an ideal option for a profitable investment. One of the defining features of this residential project is its outdoor balconies, where residents can enjoy breathtaking views of the surrounding landscape and light breezes. The architecture and interior design of these residences exude a sense of modernity and elegance, blending seamlessly into the contemporary urban landscape. The apartments for sale are spacious 1 and 2 bedroom apartments. The apartments are designed in light colors and are a haven of timeless sophistication. Flooded with natural light, the interiors exude a soothing and cool atmosphere.Residents enjoy world-class premium amenities such as a rooftop infinity pool, recreational facilities with barbecue areas, gym, sports and children's playgrounds, co-working area and a movie theater.The JVC neighborhood is well positioned to provide Gateway residents with quick access to key points in Dubai. About 7-10 minutes away is Dubai Hills Mall, Mall of the Emirates, Dubai Marina. Burj Al Arab, Burj Khalif, The Palm Jumeirah, Jumeirah Beach, Museum of the Future are just 15-20 minutes away by car. Dubai International Airport is a 30-minute drive away.","price":1123054,"title":"Gateway","bitrix":{"id":808,"pf_id":"are.2.12916","source":null,"project_id":"Gateway","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Gateway by Premier Choice","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Premier Choice","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/InszjGJHQx05NrF2aF8b9xm0dz6K2nfzj0Xzb8mj.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/464x312/InszjGJHQx05NrF2aF8b9xm0dz6K2nfzj0Xzb8mj.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1002966,"lng":55.1546144},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/fiI9RucuTpMmPOLJpJiIc8VVcdTS82QDF2TetuJd.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/464x312/fiI9RucuTpMmPOLJpJiIc8VVcdTS82QDF2TetuJd.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/AIgG6yhkpvDsXC48nIHwPvbgVZoOk98jWWWKxLIE.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/464x312/AIgG6yhkpvDsXC48nIHwPvbgVZoOk98jWWWKxLIE.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/hTgqiHGPD468RFSniMjuOPSRqLo8oPF0ES5T4dXm.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/464x312/hTgqiHGPD468RFSniMjuOPSRqLo8oPF0ES5T4dXm.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/InszjGJHQx05NrF2aF8b9xm0dz6K2nfzj0Xzb8mj.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/464x312/InszjGJHQx05NrF2aF8b9xm0dz6K2nfzj0Xzb8mj.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/fiI9RucuTpMmPOLJpJiIc8VVcdTS82QDF2TetuJd.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/464x312/fiI9RucuTpMmPOLJpJiIc8VVcdTS82QDF2TetuJd.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/443/images/2024/04/05/340x252/AIgG6yhkpvDsXC48nIHwPvbgVZoOk98jWWWKxLIE.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfr