t a backdrop of vibrant mangroves.Residents can also enjoy a wide range of sports and recreational offerings just steps away from the complex. These include a swimming pool, multi-purpose and gymnasium, golf course, beach club and Oberoi Beach Resort.Strategically located just 25 minutes from Dubai International Airport, Gateway Porto Al Zorah provides residents with convenient global connectivity while immersing them in tranquil surroundings. This landmark development on the Ajman coast is also in close proximity to the under-construction Wynn Casino in Ras Al Khaimah.","price":868856,"title":"Gateway Porto","bitrix":{"id":875,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Gateway Porto","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Gateway Porto","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Al Zorah Development","project_location":"Al Zorah City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/340x252/geR7DkHWDOmHODrP3U3NEbdqTZJ6NZlxuwkinTR6.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/464x312/geR7DkHWDOmHODrP3U3NEbdqTZJ6NZlxuwkinTR6.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.4291339,"lng":55.4511397},"country":"sharjah","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/340x252/iXSvfr8MRQ2K1OS2Ed9HCFrRvhocQbnqNoxkH5yZ.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/464x312/iXSvfr8MRQ2K1OS2Ed9HCFrRvhocQbnqNoxkH5yZ.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/340x252/9G2BT6t22JZanQNTC0CCmf5gu58JmIUc62WtNgit.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/464x312/9G2BT6t22JZanQNTC0CCmf5gu58JmIUc62WtNgit.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/340x252/geR7DkHWDOmHODrP3U3NEbdqTZJ6NZlxuwkinTR6.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/855/images/2